{"title": "Gilded Jester", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Gilded Jester</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-images\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game (Boxed)\">In-Game (Boxed)</div><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab\" data-druid=\"1-2\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game (Popped)\">In-Game (Popped)</div></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-files\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game (Boxed)\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gilded_Jester_Boxed.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Gilded Jester Boxed.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Gilded_Jester_Boxed.jpg/250px-Gilded_Jester_Boxed.jpg?d13d0d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Gilded_Jester_Boxed.jpg/375px-Gilded_Jester_Boxed.jpg?d13d0d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Gilded_Jester_Boxed.jpg/500px-Gilded_Jester_Boxed.jpg?d13d0d 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"druid-main-images-file druid-toggleable\" data-druid=\"1-2\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game (Popped)\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gilded_Jester_Popped.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Gilded Jester Popped.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Gilded_Jester_Popped.jpg/250px-Gilded_Jester_Popped.jpg?e010cb\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Gilded_Jester_Popped.jpg/375px-Gilded_Jester_Popped.jpg?e010cb 1.5x, /images/thumb/Gilded_Jester_Popped.jpg/500px-Gilded_Jester_Popped.jpg?e010cb 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nJester</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nGoldenJester</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nMauling</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnkillable</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\nInstant Kill</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.5</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.6</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Gilded Jester</b> is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Jester\">Jester</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. It is a golden jack-in-the-box with two legs, an arm, and an image of a skull on its center. When it pops open, a golden skull connected to several cables comes out of the box.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>Similar to the Jester, the <b>Gilded Jester</b> will roam around the interior until it spots a player. It will then follow that player before beginning to crank itself. After it finishes cranking, the box will pop open and the <b>Gilded Jester</b> will attempt to chase and instantly kill the closest player on contact. It will get faster the longer it chases players, but its speed will reset after it kills an employee or it is stunned. The <b>Gilded Jester</b> will only close its box and begin roaming again once all players have left the interior.\n</p><p>The <b>Gilded Jester</b> has a much faster roaming and following speed and a much longer countdown before it begins cranking compared to the Jester. However, its cranking duration is significantly shorter. It has a countdown of 80 to 100 seconds before it starts cranking and a cranking duration of 10 to 15 seconds.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Chances\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Chances\">&gt; Spawn Chances</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Gilded Jester</b> has a 45.35% chance to spawn in the interior of <a href=\"/wiki/Empra\" title=\"Empra\"><b>Empra</b></a>, typically spawning near the start of the day due to the interior spawn curve.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<p>The entry for the <b>Gilded Jester</b> is the same as the Jester.\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Jester <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">JESTER<br /><br />Sigurd's danger level: 90% Get out o fthere before it goes APE!! You cant hide from it, just evacuate. i think it goes back in its box if everyone stays outside long enough<br /><br />Scientific name: INSANEUS THINGUS<br />THERE'S NO FREAKING SCIENTIFIC RECORD! good luck, you know as much as us. we just call it the jester\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cranking Music</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"11\" data-mwtitle=\"JackInTheBoxThemeSlow.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/JackInTheBoxThemeSlow.mp3?ad2dbf\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/JackInTheBoxThemeSlow.mp3/JackInTheBoxThemeSlow.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turning Crank</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"GildedTurnCrank1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GildedTurnCrank1.mp3?4a84bf\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GildedTurnCrank1.mp3/GildedTurnCrank1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"GildedTurnCrank2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GildedTurnCrank2.mp3?c5566f\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GildedTurnCrank2.mp3/GildedTurnCrank2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"GildedTurnCrank3.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GildedTurnCrank3.mp3?501d35\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GildedTurnCrank3.mp3/GildedTurnCrank3.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Popping</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"6\" data-mwtitle=\"GildedJesterPop.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GildedJesterPop.mp3?83af6b\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GildedJesterPop.mp3/GildedJesterPop.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Screaming</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"5\" data-mwtitle=\"GildedJesterScream.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GildedJesterScream.mp3?52ffcb\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GildedJesterScream.mp3/GildedJesterScream.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chasing</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"4\" data-mwtitle=\"GildedJesterChase.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GildedJesterChase.mp3?cc0fe8\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GildedJesterChase.mp3/GildedJesterChase.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stomping</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"GildedJesterStomp1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GildedJesterStomp1.mp3?130818\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GildedJesterStomp1.mp3/GildedJesterStomp1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"GildedJesterStomp2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GildedJesterStomp2.mp3?e8f102\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GildedJesterStomp2.mp3/GildedJesterStomp2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"GildedJesterStomp3.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/GildedJesterStomp3.mp3?834c02\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/GildedJesterStomp3.mp3/GildedJesterStomp3.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:GildedJesterChase.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Gilded Jester turning its skull while chasing a player.\"><img alt=\"The Gilded Jester turning its skull while chasing a player.\" src=\"/images/thumb/GildedJesterChase.jpg/120px-GildedJesterChase.jpg?991dad\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/GildedJesterChase.jpg/180px-GildedJesterChase.jpg?991dad 1.5x, /images/thumb/GildedJesterChase.jpg/240px-GildedJesterChase.jpg?991dad 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Gilded Jester turning its skull while chasing a player.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul></div>", "images": ["Gilded_Jester_Boxed.jpg", "GildedJesterChase.jpg", "Gilded_Jester_Popped.jpg", "JackInTheBoxThemeSlow.mp3", "GildedTurnCrank1.mp3", "GildedTurnCrank2.mp3", "GildedTurnCrank3.mp3", "GildedJesterPop.mp3", "GildedJesterScream.mp3", "GildedJesterChase.mp3", "GildedJesterStomp1.mp3", "GildedJesterStomp2.mp3", "GildedJesterStomp3.mp3"], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes"]}